              <form name="form2" method="post" action="">
                <b><br>
                Roleplay Information:</b><br>
                Son of a Elven mother and an Evil human wizard, Bobobob was named by the elders of Kel, being the ever present sign of an unnatural birth they named him so in hopes that he would be ridiculed by the children and leave the tree city and not return removing what they considered a blemish from the elven city. What they didn't expect is that he instead developed his own style and worked with the less than normal name to become loved among all of Greater Fay's residence. Spending his childhood hunting down unknowing orcs he soon realized that he was lured by the druidic ways and began his studies into the ways of Tunare. During his studies he met a noble born druid named Portius and the two soon found that they were opposite ends of the same force. Portius the logical, systematic and noble(spoiled) side, and Bob the chaotic, random, and hybrid side. During his later years his human half started to cause him to fall into fits of rage that in turn released them selves as furies of flaming forest animals and various other creatures that came near him. Bob learned to focus this rage into powerful magic and is compelled to burn things that annoy or attack him. He was appropriatly given the title of Crazywolf after an incident involving 4 Ice Giants soon after he mastered the art of wolf form. He now is seen very often roaming through the ancients lands of the past searching for scrolls and artifacts that will make him more powerful so that he can prove to the elders that he was not a mistake but a fated creation of great power. Assisted by the High Eleves and wearing Chainmail made by the Eleven smiths themselves he ventures out though completely fighting with his innner demons and the corrupting power of the evil father he never knew. 
